---

---

<section id="faq" class="py-20 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-6">
                Perguntas Frequentes
            </h2>
            <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                Respostas para as dúvidas mais comuns dos nossos clientes
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6" x-data="{selected: null}">
            <!-- FAQ Item 1 -->
            <div
                class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md overflow-hidden border border-gray-100"
            >
                <div
                    @click="selected !== 1 ? selected = 1 : selected = null"
                    class="p-6 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between"
                >
                    <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800">
                        Vocês fazem entrega na minha cidade?
                    </h3>
                    <svg
                        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                        class="h-6 w-6 text-orange-500 transition-transform"
                        :class="{'rotate-180': selected === 1}"
                        fill="none"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                    >
                        <path
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div
                    x-show="selected === 1"
                    x-transition:enter="transition ease-out duration-200"
                    x-transition:enter-start="opacity-0 transform -translate-y-2"
                    x-transition:enter-end="opacity-100 transform translate-y-0"
                    class="px-6 pb-6"
                >
                    <p class="text-slate-600">
                        Sim! Atendemos toda a região. Fale com nossa equipe e
                        consulte as condições especiais de frete.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 2 -->
            <div
                class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md overflow-hidden border border-gray-100"
            >
                <div
                    @click="selected !== 2 ? selected = 2 : selected = null"
                    class="p-6 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between"
                >
                    <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800">
                        As madeiras já vêm tratadas?
                    </h3>
                    <svg
                        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                        class="h-6 w-6 text-orange-500 transition-transform"
                        :class="{'rotate-180': selected === 2}"
                        fill="none"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                    >
                        <path
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div
                    x-show="selected === 2"
                    x-transition:enter="transition ease-out duration-200"
                    x-transition:enter-start="opacity-0 transform -translate-y-2"
                    x-transition:enter-end="opacity-100 transform translate-y-0"
                    class="px-6 pb-6"
                >
                    <p class="text-slate-600">
                        Sim. Todas nossas madeiras são secas, tratadas e com
                        procedência garantida. Também fazemos cortes sob medida.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 3 -->
            <div
                class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md overflow-hidden border border-gray-100"
            >
                <div
                    @click="selected !== 3 ? selected = 3 : selected = null"
                    class="p-6 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between"
                >
                    <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800">
                        Posso comprar só telhas ou só madeira?
                    </h3>
                    <svg
                        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                        class="h-6 w-6 text-orange-500 transition-transform"
                        :class="{'rotate-180': selected === 3}"
                        fill="none"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                    >
                        <path
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div
                    x-show="selected === 3"
                    x-transition:enter="transition ease-out duration-200"
                    x-transition:enter-start="opacity-0 transform -translate-y-2"
                    x-transition:enter-end="opacity-100 transform translate-y-0"
                    class="px-6 pb-6"
                >
                    <p class="text-slate-600">
                        Claro! Trabalhamos com vendas avulsas e também com
                        pacotes completos para telhado.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 4 -->
            <div
                class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md overflow-hidden border border-gray-100"
            >
                <div
                    @click="selected !== 4 ? selected = 4 : selected = null"
                    class="p-6 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between"
                >
                    <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800">
                        Posso fazer o orçamento pelo WhatsApp?
                    </h3>
                    <svg
                        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                        class="h-6 w-6 text-orange-500 transition-transform"
                        :class="{'rotate-180': selected === 4}"
                        fill="none"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                    >
                        <path
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div
                    x-show="selected === 4"
                    x-transition:enter="transition ease-out duration-200"
                    x-transition:enter-start="opacity-0 transform -translate-y-2"
                    x-transition:enter-end="opacity-100 transform translate-y-0"
                    class="px-6 pb-6"
                >
                    <p class="text-slate-600">
                        Sim. Nossa equipe está pronta para te atender agora
                        mesmo. É só clicar no botão e falar direto com a gente.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
